# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

~> **Note:** This resource is behind a feature flag. Set the environment variable `YBM_FF_AMP=true` to use it.

Set `environment_id` for a cluster in a BYOC environment; leave it unset for a shared cluster.

`pg_settings` can be changed in place. `extensions` can be added in place but not removed. Changing `cluster_name`, `branch_name`, `parent_branch`, `fork_point_lsn` or `environment_id` replaces the branch, which deletes its data and its endpoints. The default `main` branch is created with the cluster and cannot be managed with this resource.

